{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52226","headline":"颂六十二首 五十一 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能仁矜幻苦，圣意愍重昏。\n哀愚开摄受，训诱方便门。\n法身徧法界，摄化指只园。\n俱销五道缚，共解四魔怨。\n三修祛爱马，六念静心猿。\n禅池澄定水，觉意动声喧。\n慧风吹法鼓，振我无明尘。\n常须近善友，开我未曾闻。\n（见同书卷八一《观苦部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}